---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About the Project"
	description="The purpose and structure of this Arduino data-capture project."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-08-02')}
>
	<p>
		This site documents the design and development of an Arduino-based
		measurement system.
	</p>

	<p>
		The objective is not merely to assemble some electronics. The project
		will follow the complete path from an initial question to hardware,
		firmware, calibration, repeatable data capture, analysis, and conclusions.
	</p>

	<h2>What will be documented</h2>

	<ul>
		<li>Project requirements and experimental questions</li>
		<li>Sensor and component selection</li>
		<li>Circuit prototypes and wiring</li>
		<li>Arduino firmware and data formats</li>
		<li>Calibration and sources of error</li>
		<li>Captured datasets and visualizations</li>
		<li>Interpretation of the results</li>
		<li>Failures, revisions, and lessons learned</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Project principles</h2>

	<p>
		The system should be understandable, reproducible, and inexpensive.
		Design decisions will be explained rather than merely presented, including
		approaches that do not work.
	</p>
</Layout>